{
  "uid": "humana-ipv4",
  "title": "IPv4 Address Use (admin)",
  "description": "Where IPv4 addresses go across the control plane clusters: external IPs, who holds them, node IPs, and what tenant clusters add. From kube-state-metrics, collected into Fleet Observability.",
  "tags": [
    "humana",
    "fleet-observability",
    "ipv4",
    "admin"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Metrics datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 2,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "e8b3387a-24f9-4f94-9ffc-555c6cb944f8",
          "value": "e8b3387a-24f9-4f94-9ffc-555c6cb944f8"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Control plane cluster",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kube_node_info, vcluster_platform_cluster)",
          "refId": "cluster"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kube_node_info, vcluster_platform_cluster)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Where IPv4 addresses go.** Every node takes one address from its VNet or VPC, and every LoadBalancer Service takes one external address. A tenant cluster on shared nodes adds neither: its pods run on the control plane cluster's nodes, its Services are ClusterIPs from that cluster's internal range, and its traffic comes in through the shared Istio gateway."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Fleet",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Tenant clusters",
      "description": "Tenant clusters with a host namespace on the selected control plane clusters.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (vcluster_platform_cluster, namespace) (kube_service_spec_type{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"})) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#FF6600"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "External IPs",
      "description": "Addresses assigned to LoadBalancer Services, plus any Service externalIPs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(count(kube_service_status_load_balancer_ingress{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", ip!=\"\"}) or vector(0)) + (count(kube_service_spec_external_ip{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\"}) or vector(0))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#FF6600"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 5,
      "title": "External IPs held by tenant clusters",
      "description": "LoadBalancer addresses on Services in a tenant cluster's host namespace: a tenant's own LoadBalancer Service, or a private-node control plane exposed as one.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(kube_service_status_load_balancer_ingress{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", ip!=\"\", namespace=~\"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#FF6600"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 6,
      "title": "LoadBalancers waiting for an IP",
      "description": "LoadBalancer Services with no address assigned yet. Above zero for long can mean the subnet or the public IP quota is exhausted.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(kube_service_spec_type{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", type=\"LoadBalancer\"} unless on (vcluster_platform_cluster, namespace, service) kube_service_status_load_balancer_ingress) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#FF6600"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Node IPs",
      "description": "Nodes on the selected control plane clusters: one VNet or VPC address each.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(kube_node_info{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#FF6600"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 8,
      "title": "ClusterIP Services",
      "description": "Services with only a cluster-internal address: no VNet, VPC or public address.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(kube_service_spec_type{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", type=\"ClusterIP\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#FF6600"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 9,
      "title": "External IPs per control plane cluster",
      "description": "LoadBalancer addresses and externalIPs over time.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(count by (vcluster_platform_cluster) (kube_service_status_load_balancer_ingress{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", ip!=\"\"})) + on (vcluster_platform_cluster) group_left () (count by (vcluster_platform_cluster) (kube_service_spec_external_ip{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\"}) or (0 * count by (vcluster_platform_cluster) (kube_node_info{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\"})))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{vcluster_platform_cluster}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Tenant clusters and node IPs per control plane cluster",
      "description": "Tenant clusters keep growing while node IPs stay flat: shared nodes add tenants without addresses.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count by (vcluster_platform_cluster) (count by (vcluster_platform_cluster, namespace) (kube_service_spec_type{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{vcluster_platform_cluster}} tenant clusters"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count by (vcluster_platform_cluster) (kube_node_info{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "{{vcluster_platform_cluster}} node IPs"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Who holds the addresses",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "External IPs",
      "description": "Every LoadBalancer address, and the tenant cluster that owns it when its Service is in a tenant cluster's host namespace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(kube_service_status_load_balancer_ingress{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", ip!=\"\"}, \"tenant_cluster\", \"$2\", \"namespace\", \"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"), \"project\", \"$1\", \"namespace\", \"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\")",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "vcluster_platform_cluster",
                "ip",
                "namespace",
                "service",
                "project",
                "tenant_cluster"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "vcluster_platform_cluster": 0,
              "ip": 1,
              "namespace": 2,
              "service": 3,
              "project": 4,
              "tenant_cluster": 5
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "vcluster_platform_cluster": "Control plane cluster",
              "ip": "External IP",
              "namespace": "Namespace",
              "service": "Service",
              "project": "Project",
              "tenant_cluster": "Tenant cluster"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Control plane cluster",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Services by type, per tenant cluster",
      "description": "What each tenant cluster's Services cost in addresses: ClusterIP takes none outside the cluster, LoadBalancer takes one external IP.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (vcluster_platform_cluster, project, tenant_cluster, type) (label_replace(label_replace(kube_service_spec_type{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"}, \"tenant_cluster\", \"$2\", \"namespace\", \"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"), \"project\", \"$1\", \"namespace\", \"(?:loft|p)-(.+)-v-(.+)\"))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "project",
                "tenant_cluster",
                "vcluster_platform_cluster",
                "type",
                "Value"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "project": 0,
              "tenant_cluster": 1,
              "vcluster_platform_cluster": 2,
              "type": 3,
              "Value": 4
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "project": "Project",
              "tenant_cluster": "Tenant cluster",
              "vcluster_platform_cluster": "Control plane cluster",
              "type": "Type",
              "Value": "Services"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Project",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Nodes",
      "description": "Each node's VNet or VPC address, and the pod range it was given. On AKS (Azure CNI overlay) pod ranges are overlay addresses, not VNet addresses; on GKE (VPC-native) they come from the VPC's secondary range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "kube_node_info{vcluster_platform_cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "vcluster_platform_cluster",
                "node",
                "internal_ip",
                "pod_cidr"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "vcluster_platform_cluster": 0,
              "node": 1,
              "internal_ip": 2,
              "pod_cidr": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "vcluster_platform_cluster": "Control plane cluster",
              "node": "Node",
              "internal_ip": "Node IP",
              "pod_cidr": "Pod range"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Control plane cluster",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}